<title>HONG KONG: Bank Austria HK branch sets HK$ fixed rate CD.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria HK branch sets HK$ fixed rate CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fixed rate certificates of deposit issue has been privately placed, arranger HSBC Markets said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER  BANK AUSTRIA, HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT    HK$400 MLN  COUPON     6.43 PCT   MATURITY  17.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE   FIXED RATE CD  ISS PRICE  UNDISCLOSED</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	  CALLS	NONE</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    HK$500K</p>
<p> RATING    NONE**	SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   NO	    CRS DEF    --	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY AUSTRIA     GOV LAW    HONG KONG  PAY DATE  17.DEC.96</p>
<p> ARRANGER	 HSBC MARKETS</p>
<p> PAYING AGENT   HONGKONG BANK</p>
<p> NOTES    PARI PASSU, UNSUBORDINATED DEBT</p>
<p>	    CLEARING THROUGH HK CMU</p>
<p>	    **PARENT'S RATING Aaa/AAA</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
